1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 韓頹 (Hán Tuí) is a historical figure from ancient China, but detailed records about him are scarce.
2 CONT
2 CONT Interestingly, there is mention of 韓頹當 (Hán Tuí Dāng), a Han Dynasty general and the son of 韓王信 (Hán Wáng Xìn). He was born in 200 BCE after his father fled to the Xiongnu. Later, he returned to the Han court and was granted the t
2 CONC itle Marquis of Gonggao (弓高侯)
