1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://cbdb.fas.harvard.edu/cbdbapi/person.php?id=12176 '''Liu Yikang''' 劉義康] [12176] With Wang(2) Hong (not in dataset), controlled the government during the Yuanjia period (424-453), when his elder brother reig
2 CONC ned as Wendi. Later implicated in a plot to rebel, he was allowed to die. He had moved to territory of Song Anfu county and all residents are his descendants. see. Liu Anshi's documentation in Yang Wanli, WJ, 118.1a-1b; Wang Tingg
