1 CONT           o Consort Weichi, mother of Princes Zitui and Xiaoxincheng
1 CONT           o Consort Yang, mother of Prince Tianci
1 CONT           o Consort Meng, mother of Prince Yun
1 CONT           o Consort Dugu, mother of Princes Zhen and Changshou
1 CONT           o Consort Murong, mother of Prince Tailuo
1 CONT           o Consort Weichi, mother of Prince Hu'er
1 CONT           o Consort Meng, mother of Prince Xiu
1 CONT     * Children
1 CONT           o Tuoba Jun (???), initially created the Prince of Gaoyang (created and uncreated 451), later Emperor Wencheng of Northern Wei
1 CONT           o Tuoba Xincheng (????), Prince You of Yangping (created 457, d. 470)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Zitui (????), Prince Kang of Jingzhao (created 459, d. 477)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Xiaoxincheng (?????), the Prince of Huaiyin (created 461, d. 467)[1]
1 CONT           o Tuoba Tianci (????), Prince Ling of Ruiyin (created 462, reduced to commoner rank 490)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Wanshou (????), Prince Li of Lelang (created 462, d. 463)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Luohou (????), Prince Shang of Guangping (created and d. 461)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Yun (???) (b. 447), Prince Kang of Rencheng (created 464, d. 481)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Zhen (???), Prince Hui of Nan'an (created 468, d. 496)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Changshou (????), Prince Kang of Chengyang (created 468, d. 474)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Tailuo (????), Prince Jing of Zhangwu (d. and posthumously created 468)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Hu'er (????), Prince Kang of Leling (d. and posthumously created 463)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Xiu (???), Prince Jing of Anding (created 468, d. 494)
1 CONT           o Tuoba Shen (???), the Prince of Zhao, died early
1 CONT           o Princess Anle
