1 CONT           o Murong Na (???), the Prince of Beihai (created 354)
1 CONT           o Murong Xiu (???), the Prince of Lanling (created 354)
1 CONT           o Murong Yue (???), the Prince of Anfeng (created 354)
1 CONT           o Murong De (???), initially the Duke of Liang (created 354), later the Prince of Fanyang, later Emperor Xianwu of Southern Yan
